Screenshots of the projects land here as <project-id>.webp (light) and
<project-id>-dark.webp (dark), produced by `npm run shots` (or the "Capture
project previews" workflow, which runs it on a GitHub runner). A product with
one look has only <project-id>.webp, shown in both themes. src/lib/previews.ts
matches them by project id; a project with no file here falls back to its
title, so this directory being empty is a valid state and never fails the build.
